                <value>Project files that depend on this project. &amp;#13;&amp;#10;They open in Notepad++ using the Open Project File and Dependencies command, and, if configured, are saved automatically before any ESPHome command runs.&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Dependencies:</value>
